Third-party software run by this project (not redistributed)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Dolt (https://github.com/dolthub/dolt), Apache-2.0, is run from the published
image dolthub/dolt-sql-server and is not vendored or modified here.

MySQL, phpMyAdmin, Adminer, DbGate and CloudBeaver are likewise run from their
published images under their own licences.
